 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "A bit tired today, but okay.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I work every Saturday. Sundays are all I get and they fly by.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.29,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's tough. Planning a little helps the day feel longer. Maybe a lie in, then one thing you really enjoy.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I always waste the morning doing laundry.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.31,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Could you do laundry on a weekday evening instead? Then Sunday is truly free.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hm. I could do",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.32,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "one load on Thursdays.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.64,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a great start. And try to get out of the house before noon, it makes the day feel much fuller.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay. Lie in, then out by noon.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.84,
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. And keep the evening quiet, so you start Monday rested.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.55,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "weekend_plans.dlg17"
  }
 ]
}
